 ## Background
-Compared against the proposed method in [S1] on a Linux machine with an NVIDIA RTX 3090Ti using the same number of trainable parameters [S1].
+Interactive rendering directly from compressed INRs became feasible with fV-SRN, which pairs a volumetric latent grid with a lightweight MLP [S2, unofficial]. The method was compared against a proposed multi-resolution hash encoding method on a Linux machine with an NVIDIA RTX 3090Ti using the same number of trainable parameters [S1]. The PyTorch-based training implementation may exaggerate training time differences relative to custom implementations [S1].
 
